{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"dcd42b323c4173d67fcde2078d35dc7c5a87028ebf55add4637fa61fb6319c98","ja":"3人の証言者","zh":"3名证人","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"fa3d94af07e23d5f1b5b333a1db2b45247ca5121b8baadd8d3b435b515858690","ja":"……うーん。やっぱ冷蔵庫の中には、\n茜のメモも赤い箱も見当たらないね……。","zh":"……唔——果然冰箱里既没有\n茜留的便签，也没看到红色的箱子呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"734325c4463d3ff2cd235b93590000815fcaa76532762e608f0c96c841077bb2","ja":"チョコはどこに消えたのか……！\n昨日のお昼まではあったはずだから……。","zh":"巧克力到底消失去哪了……！\n昨天中午明明应该还在的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e4d42bcff471cdc1c4b8a0b8b0e8fc44ccf5daa13df1e08696b0b990a52aa33c","ja":"よし、まずは昨日劇場にいた子たちに、\n聞き込み開始だ～～！","zh":"好，首先向昨天在剧场的孩子们，\n开始打听情况吧～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d4debf2b7c97e277da549c336619a9f8c3a9d05c437583519cc6db377b601085","ja":"……ということで、紗代子ちゃん！\n知っていること、洗いざらい話してもらうよ！","zh":"……所以说，纱代子！\n把你所知道的一切，全都给我招出来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"656546ba2fe24296604659a72bfc1e0aa6980622992cacaffcd6ee63a6a8af71","ja":"メモ付きのチョコ……？　そういえば、\n昨日の夜、冷蔵庫が調子悪くなっちゃったんだよね。","zh":"附有便签的巧克力……？说起来，\n昨晚冰箱好像出故障了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ad8df3de29ac330367202225cc5339dbb3ff22f87066d7ef00d7d418dd18b334","ja":"修理の業者さんを呼ぶからって、\n中身を全部テーブルに移動させたんだよ。","zh":"因为要叫维修师傅过来，\n所以把里面的东西全移到桌子上了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1364dbbbf5147ebe5ba6ca131a2f353e0d3cc3b91bd6645f73e0dac5ee42cdb7","ja":"ふんふん……。キッチンのテーブルにはもう\n何もなかったよね。その後また冷蔵庫に戻したの？","zh":"嗯嗯……餐桌上已经\n什么都没有了吧。之后又放回冰箱里了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"201c005a60580cbee650f499dc928ce1161aa43053a81e4ce0909bbf18c211a1","ja":"ううん。私は用事があったから、\nテーブルに置いた後は未来ちゃんに引き継いだの。","zh":"没有。因为我有事要办，\n放在桌上之后就交接给未来了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4d7884a710d8798e624c05fb01dcd18ab41ecf86a944f87516d44edf70ba3fd9","ja":"なるほど。ということは……、\n次は未来ちゃんに聞き込みだー！","zh":"原来如此。这么说来……\n接下来要去向未来打听消息啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8d3926a31b42213f35cb9772d5af9406bf83045d8005ef188d29180bc32d5fe3","ja":"テーブルにあった冷蔵庫の中身？\nうん、私が移動させたよ！","zh":"桌上冰箱里的东西？\n嗯，是我挪走的哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"5419b8f8006c05124f7aed757a46aa5fff24511f5f77d7c5467c1ba57ead581b","ja":"クーラーボックスの中に、\n全部バッチリ入れておいたからね！","zh":"保温箱里都\n已经妥妥放好啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"e59ce5422efc31b641ecd80f7554cc4e6f90f7c74e45b34d9b2d241fcc7afb49","ja":"あ……それなら今日の、朝……。\n冷蔵庫の……修理が、終わったから……。","zh":"啊……如果是那个的话，今天早上……\n冰箱……已经修好了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d945ae87ff65f5f03b7c1e010323c78c539486e33a5715d2ee90f012f8bcaa3b","ja":"クーラーボックスに入ってた物は……\n杏奈が、冷蔵庫に……戻したよ……。","zh":"保温箱里的东西……\n杏奈……已经放回冰箱了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"764289e55b8e6c10f267d7e07276e3b10707c7dfb0f1a7d1b84f584b50970ed3","ja":"ふにゃ～～！？　結局チョコは冷蔵庫の中！？\nで、でも、実際入ってなかったわけだし……！","zh":"喵呜～～！？结果巧克力还是在冰箱里吗！？\n但、但是，实际上之前确实没有在里面嘛……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"d0f6a5a0b980f9d26a6f08aa62f32dc241a0a8a3580e2f1b1deb87188b0c3c23","ja":"謎は深まるばかりだね……\nもう1回冷蔵庫、見に行こっか？","zh":"谜团越来越深了呢……\n再去冰箱那边看1次吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"dd71ac492f113841c4454551669bc152c9bbdf971aaa2bfe17dda57211337263","ja":"そうだね……こうなったら\n現場検証、トコトンやってみるしかない！","zh":"也是呢……事到如今，\n只能把现场勘查彻底做到底了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1000.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"e43b3ffe02bc0580a723e285b0543b27740abff2c83e3a2a66f88793313aae9f","ja":"私も手伝うよ！\n人数が増えた方が、見つかる確率も上がるしね！","zh":"我也来帮忙！\n人多一点的话，找到的概率也会更高嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
